{"id":"0d2eafa7efbe1e51","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-finite-injury-compatibility.md","title":"Finite Injury Compatibility","display":"df-finite-injury-compatibility — Finite Injury Compatibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-finite-injury-compatibility","aliases":["68-df-finite-injury-compatibility"],"display":"df-finite-injury-compatibility — Finite Injury Compatibility","depends_on":["[[68-df-priority-argument]]"],"source_location":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework","verification_status":"local-framework-definition","source_proof_status":"not-a-book-theorem","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-finite-injury-compatibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-finite-injury-compatibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-injury-compatibility — Finite Injury Compatibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" href=\"?note=1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" title=\"68-df-priority-argument\">68-df-priority-argument</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-framework-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-a-book-theorem"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\">\\(R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PriorityArg}\">\\(\\mathrm{PriorityArg}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Act}\">\\(\\mathrm{Act}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inj}\">\\(\\mathrm{Inj}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" href=\"?note=1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" title=\"68-df-priority-argument\">68-df-priority-argument</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}\\)</span> 为以下引入的四参数局部验证谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{PriorityArg}(A,R,a,b)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl((\\exists t_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall t\\ge t_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Act}(b,e,t))\\land A\\in R(e)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{PriorityArg}(A,R,a,b)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl((\\exists t_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall t\\ge t_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Act}(b,e,t))\\land A\\in R(e)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地逐策略验证条件：在第 e 个策略不再受较高优先策略初始化的条件下，必须另行证明它只行动有限次并满足自己的要求。这是每个具体策略的证明义务；本定义没有证明这些条件可实现。</p>\n<p>条件并未预先假定全部要求满足：若较高优先策略永久行动，下游条件可能尚未触发。有限伤害验证引理利用按 e 的归纳排除这种情况。旧版兼容性仅假定 Sat(R_e,A_s) 最终成立，既未要求有效构造，也没有从有限近似到极限对象的传递依据；该旧接口不可继续作为通用方法前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-priority-argument","status":"resolved","id":"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-argument]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-priority-argument","status":"resolved","id":"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$，$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{PriorityArg}$、$\\mathrm{Act}$、$\\mathrm{Inj}$ 见 [[68-df-priority-argument]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PriorityArg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Act}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inj}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{PriorityArg}(A,R,a,b)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl((\\exists t_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall t\\ge t_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Act}(b,e,t))\\land A\\in R(e)\\bigr)\\Bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1847,"backlinks":[{"id":"893e72411706379e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$，$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}$、$\\mathrm{FinInjury}$、$\\mathrm{RE}$ 分别见 [[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility]]、[[68-df-finite-injury]]、[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility|df-finite-injury-compatibility — Finite Injury Compatibility]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility|df-finite-injury-compatibility — Finite Injury Compatibility]]"}],"outgoing":["1cd6ef5cb51a39c5"]}